 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Great. Start by deciding what kind of day you want, from casual get together to an activity they'll all love. Then plan things that are relaxed but comfortable, air conditioning and plenty of water. If you don' mind a lot of cooking, go for it. Otherwise, do a couple of shared dishes and rent a big table. Perfect. Put it on the table first, it sets the tone beautifully. Think about the older relatives and anyone with children. Don't assume everyone will get along with everyone else.",
